  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TEA Demonstrator - Scale-up of ENACT in Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scale-up of the Enabling African Cities for Transformative Energy Access (ENACT) project in Uganda to create an enabling environment for the public and private sector to work together in improving clean and affordable energy access (especially clean cooking) for the urban poor living in urban informal settlements.</narrative>
  </description>
